silm:instances_papers_03_silmaril_federation_chapters_01_foundational_thesis_and_anchors_sections_03_olog_node_arrow_law_concrete_anchor_node_a a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.03_silmaril_federation.chapters.01_foundational_thesis_and_anchors.sections.03_olog_node_arrow_law.concrete_anchor.node_a" .
silm:instances_papers_03_silmaril_federation_chapters_01_foundational_thesis_and_anchors_sections_03_olog_node_arrow_law_concrete_anchor_node_a silm:hasLongDescription "The VetRecord_Mittens is Node A in the olog node-arrow diagram is VetRecord_Mittens — the physical veterinary record for Mittens. It is the domain of the lambda_evidence arrow and the storedAs arrow. It is a source, not the apex." .
silm:instances_papers_03_silmaril_federation_chapters_01_foundational_thesis_and_anchors_sections_03_olog_node_arrow_law_concrete_anchor_node_b a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.03_silmaril_federation.chapters.01_foundational_thesis_and_anchors.sections.03_olog_node_arrow_law.concrete_anchor.node_b" .
silm:instances_papers_03_silmaril_federation_chapters_01_foundational_thesis_and_anchors_sections_03_olog_node_arrow_law_concrete_anchor_node_b silm:hasLongDescription "The StoragePacket_Mittens is Node B in the composition diagram is StoragePacket_Mittens — the storage packet produced from the vet record via storedAs. It is the codomain of storedAs and the domain of lambda_storage. Intermediate node in the composition law." .
silm:instances_papers_03_silmaril_federation_chapters_01_foundational_thesis_and_anchors_sections_03_olog_node_arrow_law_concrete_anchor_node_c a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.03_silmaril_federation.chapters.01_foundational_thesis_and_anchors.sections.03_olog_node_arrow_law.concrete_anchor.node_c" .
silm:instances_papers_03_silmaril_federation_chapters_01_foundational_thesis_and_anchors_sections_03_olog_node_arrow_law_concrete_anchor_node_c silm:hasLongDescription "The MittensGovernedIndividual is Node C in the composition diagram is Mittens — the governed individual cat, the colimit apex. The codomain of both lambda_evidence (direct path) and lambda_storage circ storedAs (composed path). The two paths must agree: this IS the commutativity law." .
